{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nprimes = []\r\nfor p in range(2, 6000):\r\n    is_prime = True\r\n    for p2 in primes:\r\n        if p2*p2 > p:\r\n            break\r\n        if p % p2==0:\r\n            is_prime = False\r\n            break\r\n    if is_prime:\r\n        primes.append(p)\r\n        \r\ndef factor(n):\r\n    d = {}\r\n    for p in primes:\r\n        if p*p > n:\r\n            break\r\n        if n % p==0:\r\n            c = 0\r\n            while n % p==0:\r\n                n = n//p\r\n                c+=1\r\n            d[p] = c\r\n    if n > 1:\r\n        d[n] = 1\r\n    return d\r\n\r\ndef factors(n):\r\n    d = factor(n)\r\n    answer = [1]\r\n    for p in d:\r\n        a2 = []\r\n        for x in answer:\r\n            for i in range(d[p]+1):\r\n                a2.append(x*p**i)\r\n        answer = a2\r\n    return answer\r\n        \r\n\r\ndef process(n, m):\r\n    f_dict = {0: 0, 1: 1, 2: 2}\r\n    for i in range(3, n+1):\r\n        f_dict[i] = 2*f_dict[i-1]\r\n        for x in factors(i):\r\n            if 2 <= x <= i:\r\n                f_dict[i] += f_dict[(i//x)]-f_dict[(i-1)//x]\r\n                f_dict[i] = f_dict[i] % m\r\n        f_dict[i] = f_dict[i] % m\r\n    return f_dict[n]\r\n\r\nn, m = [int(x) for x in input().split()]\r\nprint(process(n, m))\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "openai/gpt-4.1-nano"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "import java.util.*;\nimport java.io.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        String[] input = br.readLine().split(\" \");\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(input[0]);\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(input[1]);\n\n        List<Integer> primes = new ArrayList<>();\n        for (int p = 2; p < 6000; p++) {\n            boolean isPrime = true;\n            for (int p2 : primes) {\n                if (p2 * p2 > p) {\n                    break;\n                }\n                if (p % p2 == 0) {\n                    isPrime = false;\n                    break;\n                }\n            }\n            if (isPrime) {\n                primes.add(p);\n            }\n        }\n\n        Map<Long, Map<Long, Integer>> factorCache = new HashMap<>();\n\n        Map<Long, Integer> factor(long n) {\n            if (factorCache.containsKey(n)) {\n                return factorCache.get(n);\n            }\n            Map<Long, Integer> d = new HashMap<>();\n            long tempN = n;\n            for (int p : primes) {\n                long pLong = p;\n                if (pLong * pLong > tempN) {\n                    break;\n                }\n                if (tempN % pLong == 0) {\n                    int c = 0;\n                    while (tempN % pLong == 0) {\n                        tempN /= pLong;\n                        c++;\n                    }\n                    d.put(pLong, c);\n                }\n            }\n            if (tempN > 1) {\n                d.put(tempN, 1);\n            }\n            factorCache.put(n, d);\n            return d;\n        }\n\n        List<Long> factors(long n) {\n            Map<Long, Integer> d = factor(n);\n            List<Long> answer = new ArrayList<>();\n            answer.add(1L);\n            for (Map.Entry<Long, Integer> entry : d.entrySet()) {\n                long p = entry.getKey();\n                int exp = entry.getValue();\n                List<Long> newAnswer = new ArrayList<>();\n                for (Long x : answer) {\n                    for (int i = 0; i <= exp; i++) {\n                        newAnswer.add(x * pow(p, i));\n                    }\n                }\n                answer = newAnswer;\n            }\n            return answer;\n        }\n\n        long process(int n, int m) {\n            Map<Integer, Integer> f_dict = new HashMap<>();\n            f_dict.put(0, 0);\n            f_dict.put(1, 1);\n            f_dict.put(2, 2);\n            for (int i = 3; i <= n; i++) {\n                int val = 2 * f_dict.get(i - 1);\n                for (Long x : factors(i)) {\n                    if (2 <= x && x <= i) {\n                        int numerator = f_dict.get(i / x);\n                        int denominator = f_dict.get((i - 1) / x);\n                        val += numerator - denominator;\n                        val %= m;\n                    }\n                }\n                val %= m;\n                f_dict.put(i, val);\n            }\n            return f_dict.get(n);\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(process(n, m));\n    }\n\n    private static long pow(long base, int exp) {\n        long result = 1;\n        for (int i = 0; i < exp; i++) {\n            result *= base;\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.9\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.0016572092426940799, -5.512236498361744e-07, -2.7968066206085496e-05, -0.49880191683769226, -0.04366595298051834, -2.8087270038668066e-05, -0.1587602198123932, -0.0005875834613107145, -0.00015669701679144055